# Allowlist: ignore everything, then admit only what the image needs.
# Anything not listed here (.env, *.db, venv, keys, snapshots, uploads,
# generated inventories, docs, tests) can never enter the build context.
*

!app/
!ansible/playbooks/
!ansible/inventory/hosts.ini
!config.py
!wsgi.py
!manage.py
!requirements.txt
!VERSION

# Never ship bytecode or editor junk that slipped inside the allowed dirs.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
